+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_1003": "Lightning strikes, burning fires, shining lights! The battle rages on!",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_1004": "The Cubie Warriors prevail! A round of applause for our heroes, everyone!",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_1005": "Phew... We're almost at the end!",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_2001": "One of these Cubes is not like the others!",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_2002": "These Cubie Warriors look like they mean serious business.",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_2003": "Before going on stage, Suisui offered a small present to every single Cube.",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_2004": "\"I'm a Cube... This feels interesting.\"",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelDes_2005": "Stick around, cuz the show is about to get exciting!",
