+  "DangoBrawlLevelEnvDes_1004": "This new contestant has a huge and heavy umbrella. You think she'll get blown away in the wind because of the umbrella?",
+  "DangoBrawlLevelEnvDes_1005": "What you're about to face is no ordinary Cube. She claims to go by the name of the Legendary Knight Cube!",
