+  "DangoBrawlTalk_jinxi_01": "Awaiting your guidance.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_jinxi_02": "I stand ready.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_jinxi_03": "Victory awaits.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_jinxi_04": "Something new for a change.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_jinxi_05": "Understood. I will hold nothing back.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_katixiya_01": "True form... No, I shall be the one to face you.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_katixiya_02": "The knight's challenge has arrived!",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_katixiya_03": "Like tilting at windmills...",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_katixiya_04": "Would you like to test my blade?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_katixiya_05": "Did someone just say \"Pizza Tropicale\"?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_linnai_01": "My turn!",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_linnai_02": "Made your pick? Let's go!",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_linnai_03": "Getting competitive are we?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_linnai_04": "I'm pretty good at this, you know.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_linnai_05": "What if I straight up win?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_piaobozhe_01": "I'll bring us victory.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_piaobozhe_02": "Here comes the fun part.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_piaobozhe_03": "Ready.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_piaobozhe_04": "I won't hold back.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_piaobozhe_05": "I agree.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_suisui_01": "We're up, Dumpling. Dumpling? Where'd you go?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_suisui_02": "It's true. Seeing is believing.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_suisui_03": "What to you say we take a breather after this one?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_suoming_01": "Hmm.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_suoming_02": "Splendid.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_suoming_03": "'Tis but a child's play.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xigelika_01": "I'll spare no effort!",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xigelika_02": "Runes, lend me your strength.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xigelika_03": "This feels kinda tense...",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xigelika_04": "What should I do?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xigelika_05": "Are you all here for the expedition? Huh? A fight?",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xinyuehu_01": "Win or defeat, it matters not. Simply enjoy.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xinyuehu_02": "Hmm, intriguing. I must investigate further...",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xinyuehu_03": "If you win, I shall grant you a small favor.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xinyuehu_04": "The trick lies in the \"heart.\"",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xinyuehu_05": "Don't let me down.",
+  "DangoBrawlTalk_xuanling_01": "The wind bears tidings of victory...",
