+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_1": "Look who it is! Hello {PlayerName}! It's been a long, long time!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_10": "Once upon a time, in the Wooly Kingdom far, far away... So begins the story.",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_11": "The Cubie Warriors find themselves before the greatest stage of their lives! Place memory stickers onto pages filled with blessings, and a magnificent battle awaits!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_12": "So, what exciting and thrilling battles hold in store for us on the stage of the Wooly? Just think about it, isn't this a hundred times... no, a gazillion times more fun than some lame-o homework?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_13": "With that, together with everyone at the Second Coming of Solaris, I managed to introduce the story into the game.",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_14": "Now, everyone in Solaris can visit the Wooly Kingdom and experience my stories! Isn't that the best?!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_15": "Whaddya say, {PlayerName}? Wanna become a Hero?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_16": "Alright, Alright.",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_17": "What's the name of the game?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_18": "Huzzah! Onwards, Black Cat Warrior! To Cubie Wars we go!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_19": "It's called Cubie Wars!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_2": "Any new stories to share, Encore?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_20": "Don't forget to share your thoughts with Encore after you try it out!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_3": "Is your homework done yet, Encore?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_4": "That's what I was gonna ask you! You were off on one big adventure! From Ragunna to Septimont, then to whatever that place is called. And Ragunna to Mengzhou...",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_5": "So many places! So many stories! And you didn't share any of them with Captain Wooly! Did you forget about our promise?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_6": "But anyway, Encore's got a really cool story to share with you!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_7": "Oh, stop it with the homework already. Remember how Aalto used it as an excuse for not taking me on missions? He's such a meanie!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_8": "And don't get me started on that one time when you and Ms. Chisa got to hang out at the cafe, while poor little Encore had to stay behind and wrestle with weird maths from Shorekeeper...",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_1_9": "But anyway, when I worked through the maths, A really cool story came into my mind!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_1": "Well, {PlayerName}? Have you tried out Cubie Wars yet?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_10": "So when do I get to go on an adventure with everyone? With you...?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_11": "Maybe when I have time...",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_12": "Have time... Got it! Then I hope you're not busy all the time, {PlayerName}...",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_13": "Promise that we'll go on adventures, water flowers, and save the world together!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_14": "Pinky swear!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_2": "It's a fun game.",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_3": "It's got potential for more interesting gameplay...",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_4": "Oh... Oh! Told ya so! My favorite part is where the Cubie Warriors raise their swords and use their cool skills. Like \"bang\"! And \"pow\"!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_5": "Yeah! I gotta share this with everyone at the Second Coming of Solaris!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_6": "Yeah... I guess there's still room for improvement... Add more interesting gameplay. How do we do that, I wonder...?",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_7": "Well, the world of Wooly Kingdom will continue to grow, and so will there be more stories and adventures. You'll be in for a real treat!",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_8": "But still, aside from these adventures, I want to explore the world on my own.",
+  "EVENT_TTYZDLD_2_9": "I've been doing a great job on all the homework Shorekeeper's been giving me lately, and even helped out Aalto with some tasks from KU-Roro.",
   "EVENT_XYJLN_10_1": "Disciple, today I shall test your guqin artistry, and see how well you've mastered the section taught earlier.",
