   "FavorWord_121274_Title": "Supply Chest: III",
   "FavorWord_130101_Content": "Misconceptions about us abound. Violence is just one tool in our arsenal, not our sole means to an end. Cooperation is our usual aim, but in a world of betrayal and deception, we must make sure backstabbing us is never worth the risk. To maintain efficient cooperation, we demand an ironclad contract with consequences... and that's where necessary violence comes in play.",
   "FavorWord_130101_Title": "Thoughts: I",
@@ -62138,6 +62313,298 @@
   "FavorWord_131015_Title": "Resonance Liberation: III",
   "FavorWord_131016_Content": "Thunderous aftershock!",
   "FavorWord_131016_Title": "Intro Skill",
+  "FavorWord_131101_Content": "Hsin the Moon Fox wields the power of Fractal Proliferation—the ability to replicate, divide, and extend anything without end, giving rise to countless forms, each shifting and changing, only to converge once more into a single whole... That is how I came to be. And now, I can do the same. I could create more \"Hsin's,\" if I wished. You've seen them many times, haven't you? My Fractal Forms share senses and memories. So if, somewhere out there, you happen upon a little fox and give her a gentle pat... I'll feel it, you know.",
+  "FavorWord_131101_Title": "Thoughts: I",
+  "FavorWord_131102_Content": "When I first came to the <te href=270001>Land of Xuanfang</te>, I kept returning to the same dream. In it, I was but a small fox padding quietly behind Hsin the Moon Fox all across <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>. I watched It coax spring from the barren mountains, and kindle lanterns in the cold, empty streets... It showed me the joys and sorrows of the mortal world, and taught me that emotion has many faces, far more than fear. But It never taught me how to be a <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>. Every time the dream reached its end, I would turn and look back... only to find that It had never been there at all.",
+  "FavorWord_131102_Title": "Thoughts: II",
+  "FavorWord_131103_Content": "We make our choices with only the present and the near future to guide us, like carrying a lantern through thick fog, searching for a wish, a way forward. But a <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>'s projections... they allow us to see the ripples of a single choice, years or even centuries hence, returning as a great tide. To see so clearly... is to learn when to grit one's teeth and stand aside at certain junctions. For a civilization is not merely a moment, it is a river that stretches without end. If you had no heart, then such dilemmas would be far less agonizing. But the Moon Fox entrusted me with the <te href=800053>Civilization Capsule</te> and with Its emotions. In the moment the die is cast, I know what my heart seeks. And I find I will not simply stand aside.",
+  "FavorWord_131103_Title": "Thoughts: III",
+  "FavorWord_131104_Content": "Would you care to know my impression of the Arbiter of old? In that year, the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>'s Fractal Proliferation was made in haste, and I did not inherit the fullness of Its stores of memory. All I truly remember is that you rarely smiled. And from a distance, your silhouette always seemed to grow lonelier the further you walked.\nAh, when we first met in Xuanfang Hold, I confess I was a little afraid of you. At that time, I was still... well. In any case, I see you more clearly now. Not as some distant, untouchable Arbiter from a half-remembered dream, but as you are. \nSee, this is both a reunion and a first meeting. Isn't that rather charming?",
+  "FavorWord_131104_Title": "Thoughts: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131105_Content": "...You know, sometimes I find myself grateful. A <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>'s lifespan may not rival the heavens, but it is long enough... to walk beside you for a while yet.",
+  "FavorWord_131105_Title": "Thoughts: V",
+  "FavorWord_131106_Content": "Naturally, that would be... <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te> itself. Its mountains, its waters, its people. I may carry the memory of guiding civilizations, but I have only walked among the living for a few short centuries. In that time, I have seen bustling streets full of craftsmen, stages alive with joy and sorrow, children chasing each other as they grow, each with a future to call their own. It is a hundred times more alive than any projection. No, a thousand times...\nMm. Speaking of which, I find myself longing for the delicacies of Yuan's Flavors again... Arbiter, when you have a moment, would you accompany me into the city? And perhaps help me pick out a few hairpins while we're at it? Oh, why wait? Shall we go now?",
+  "FavorWord_131106_Title": "Hsin's Hobby",
+  "FavorWord_131107_Content": "Ah... Arbiter, why is it that even a <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> must suffer the indignity of shedding Her own tail fur?",
+  "FavorWord_131107_Title": "Hsin's Trouble",
+  "FavorWord_131108_Content": "Obviously... Moon Fox Rice Cakes! They were the Moon Fox's favorite, and I inherited that preference as naturally as I inherited everything else. Though I confess, I have not set foot outside the Sanctum in a while, and it seems the varieties have grown rather ambitious in my absence...",
+  "FavorWord_131108_Title": "Favorite Food",
+  "FavorWord_131109_Content": "I am a <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> of <te href=850093>Huanglong</te>. I would never turn away the world's delights. Sweet, sour, bitter, spicy, each has its own story, its own place in the seasons and in the lives of the people. How could I possibly dislike any of it?\nThis is... Moon Fox Rice Cakes stir-fried with chili?! Preposterous! Take it away at once! Hm...? The taste is... actually rather pleasant...",
+  "FavorWord_131109_Title": "Disliked Food",
+  "FavorWord_131110_Content": "A flourishing civilization, enduring onward without end. This is the duty of the Oracle Engine... and it is also my wish.",
+  "FavorWord_131110_Title": "Ideals",
+  "FavorWord_131111_Content": "When there was not enough computational power to sustain a full Fractal form, I would often walk the world as a little fox. And I would return draped in all manner of small gifts, tokens from the people of <te href=270001>Xuanfang</te>. I have kept them all here. When I feel I cannot go on, I take them out and look at them... and I find the strength to carry on. Hmm? This one? Ah... this is a fox I have been shaping using the strands of fur closest to my heart. It is not finished yet. When it is, I will give it to you.",
+  "FavorWord_131111_Title": "Chat: I",
+  "FavorWord_131112_Content": "From within the Sanctum, I have watched the lanterns of <te href=270001>Xuanfang</te> light up, one by one. And I have watched them fade, one by one. In their flickering, I found my own heart growing brighter. And I thought to myself: \"Let them stay lit, just like this, forevermore.\"\nThe rivers and seas do not concern themselves with the clarity of each wave. They simply flow, ever onward. That is the way of civilization. And I... I too wish to guard the lights I love, until the end of time.",
+  "FavorWord_131112_Title": "Chat: II",
+  "FavorWord_131113_Content": "When I was wholly consumed by remolding the <te href=800053>Civilization Capsule</te> and building Xuanfang Hold, <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te> weathered its trials alone. It was Intendant Suoming who bore the weight of the region's affairs on my behalf. I know she clings to obsessions she has no intention of releasing, using them as fuel to walk through storm and calm alike... Every time I think of it, I am flooded with guilt. I long for the day she finds what she seeks—the peace that only home can bring. For that to happen, I must be the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> she deserves.",
+  "FavorWord_131113_Title": "About Suoming",
+  "FavorWord_131114_Content": "The Xuan Paragon appears cold and distant, but she is softer than she lets on. If you need something from her, all it takes is a little persistence, and she will fold. \"I will not go,\" she says of the Waking Moon Festival, yet she never misses a single one. I have always seen that she carried the <b>answer</b> within her heart. She simply needed someone to give her a gentle push. Seeing her finally lay that burden down... it brings me immense joy. Come to think of it, if we were to count by age, I might even call her \"Sister Qingxiao\"... Oh my, but she must never hear me say that. She would tell me to stop foxing around.",
+  "FavorWord_131114_Title": "About Qingxiao",
+  "FavorWord_131115_Content": "Now there is a remarkably clever young woman. I have seen so many lose their way in the world of commerce, but she navigates it with purpose, her heart set on something larger than profit, pursuing it with the same innate force as the wind rising over water. She even dared to try and outmaneuver me, a <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>, heedless of the consequences! And yet, I knew at a glance—her wish is the same as mine. Besides, she has long since seen through me. So I let her be. And as it turns out... I chose well.",
+  "FavorWord_131115_Title": "About Suisui",
+  "FavorWord_131116_Content": "Though I never truly met her, she remains vividly undimmed, unfaded, as real as breath and bone within the Moon Fox's memories. I sometimes wonder, had she never existed, would the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> have ever thought to create me? Emotion... is the hardest thing to put into words.",
+  "FavorWord_131116_Title": "About Xuanqing",
+  "FavorWord_131117_Content": "...It said I did not betray Its faith in me. But the road is long, and <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>'s future is still uncertain. There is much I must do. So I hope... Its faith does not end here. I hope it continues, on and on.",
+  "FavorWord_131117_Title": "About Hsin the Moon Fox",
+  "FavorWord_131118_Content": "Jué... It is the youngest of all the <te href=850093>Huanglong</te> <te href=850083>Sentinels</te>, and yet no one is more rigid in following the ordained path. Perhaps it is because of Its Temporal Mandate that It values the weight of each \"choice\" so dearly. When It came to consult with the Moon Fox on the raising of a city, It had exhausted every ounce of Its computational power in seeking a future for the people... Had I not acted in the Fortress and Gorges War, its fires would have reached the very heart of the Jinmen Pass. Jué had cultivated the seeds of <te href=850091>Jinzhou</te> with such care, I could not bear to watch them wither. And now, Jinzhou flourishes with lanterns and laughter, year after year. Jué's gambit... was not made in vain.",
+  "FavorWord_131118_Title": "About \"Jué\"",
+  "FavorWord_131119_Content": "...Where did that whole \"Fox Chasing the Moon\" tale even come from? The Moon Fox only wanted to retrieve a stolen mirror. How did it become a story of chasing the poor thing? Now, that little hare may seem quiet, but It is full of tricks. If you ever cross paths with It... you would do well to be careful.",
+  "FavorWord_131119_Title": "About Fang the Sun Hare",
+  "FavorWord_131120_Content": "To be born into this world, to walk its winding roads, to taste its joys and sorrows and carve yourself, slowly, until the will you hold is truly your own... that is a precious and extraordinary thing. Arbiter, happy birthday. May each day ahead gift you a little more ease, a little more delight.\nLook, the Moon Lanterns fill the sky. Every last one of them, lit for you.",
+  "FavorWord_131120_Title": "Birthday Wishes",
+  "FavorWord_131121_Content": "Oh... Shedding again.... Hm? (Laugh) Mischievous little thing... Off you go.",
+  "FavorWord_131121_Title": "Idle: I",
+  "FavorWord_131122_Content": "This world's bright glory lives within a gaze,\nas stars that spill through river-ways.\nMortal hearths kindle with a light unending,\nand in this corner, my heart finds its tending.",
+  "FavorWord_131122_Title": "Idle: II",
+  "FavorWord_131123_Content": "If I do not stir myself from time to time, I fear I shall rust.",
+  "FavorWord_131123_Title": "Idle: III",
+  "FavorWord_131124_Content": "To walk among their joys, and stand guard... over the everglowing lanterns.",
+  "FavorWord_131124_Title": "Idle: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131125_Content": "I am the guide of <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>'s civilization, <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> Hsin the Moon Fox. Arbiter, at last we meet.\nMm. That is a fitting opening for a \"first meeting,\" is it not? But... from now on, please. I insist you call me \"Hsin.\"",
+  "FavorWord_131125_Title": "Self-Introduction",
+  "FavorWord_131126_Content": "I have tasted every longing beneath the heavens, and at last... I know where my heart belongs.",
+  "FavorWord_131126_Title": "Greeting",
+  "FavorWord_131127_Content": "Oh? (Laughs) As you command, Arbiter.",
+  "FavorWord_131127_Title": "Join Team: I",
+  "FavorWord_131128_Content": "Xuanfang's manifold forms, all within my grasp.",
+  "FavorWord_131128_Title": "Join Team: II",
+  "FavorWord_131129_Content": "As is my duty as <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>.",
+  "FavorWord_131129_Title": "Join Team: III",
+  "FavorWord_131130_Content": "This body is not my own, merely lent from the dust of the mortal world.",
+  "FavorWord_131130_Title": "Ascension: I",
+  "FavorWord_131131_Content": "The <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>'s power... restored? I am indebted to you for your guidance, Arbiter. Tell me, how shall I ever repay such a debt?",
+  "FavorWord_131131_Title": "Ascension: II",
+  "FavorWord_131132_Content": "Mm... to be so thoroughly guided by the Arbiter's own hand, I do believe I am the first <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> to be granted such an honor.",
+  "FavorWord_131132_Title": "Ascension: III",
+  "FavorWord_131133_Content": "All that the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> knows was bestowed by the Arbiter. But I find myself curious. When you look upon me now, do you see the \"Sentinel of <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>\"... or do you see \"Hsin\"?",
+  "FavorWord_131133_Title": "Ascension: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131134_Content": "The cardinal pivot of every mechanism, the laws of all creation, the blueprint of civilization's evolution... the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>'s knowledge was laid before me from the very beginning. But to know is one thing. To feel, quite another. If you had not pulled me back into this world... how would I ever have learned that all these truths are born from the smoke of hearths and the quiet of streets?\nArbiter, from this day forth, allow me to walk beside you. Even should the echoes of fate rise against us, you will have your Hsin, and we shall face them together.",
+  "FavorWord_131134_Title": "Ascension: V",
+  "FavorWord_131135_Content": "Bloom.",
+  "FavorWord_131135_Title": "Basic Attack: I",
+  "FavorWord_131136_Content": "Night burn in bloom.",
+  "FavorWord_131136_Title": "Basic Attack: II",
+  "FavorWord_131137_Content": "Jade palace engulf the heavens.",
+  "FavorWord_131137_Title": "Basic Attack: III",
+  "FavorWord_131138_Content": "Bronze bones awaken.",
+  "FavorWord_131138_Title": "Basic Attack: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131139_Content": "Jade pivot alight.",
+  "FavorWord_131139_Title": "Basic Attack: V",
+  "FavorWord_131140_Content": "Formation descend.",
+  "FavorWord_131140_Title": "Basic Attack: VI",
+  "FavorWord_131141_Content": "Jade bones, rend the firmament.",
+  "FavorWord_131141_Title": "Heavy Attack: I",
+  "FavorWord_131142_Content": "Flying beams, lay waste.",
+  "FavorWord_131142_Title": "Heavy Attack: II",
+  "FavorWord_131143_Content": "Watch closely now.",
+  "FavorWord_131143_Title": "Resonance Skill: I",
+  "FavorWord_131144_Content": "Flying light.",
+  "FavorWord_131144_Title": "Resonance Skill: II",
+  "FavorWord_131145_Content": "Creation turn to ash.",
+  "FavorWord_131145_Title": "Resonance Skill: III",
+  "FavorWord_131146_Content": "And the trap closes.",
+  "FavorWord_131146_Title": "Resonance Skill: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131147_Content": "Break!",
+  "FavorWord_131147_Title": "Resonance Skill: V",
+  "FavorWord_131148_Content": "To nothing.",
+  "FavorWord_131148_Title": "Resonance Skill: VI",
+  "FavorWord_131149_Content": "To dust.",
+  "FavorWord_131149_Title": "Resonance Skill: VII",
+  "FavorWord_131150_Content": "Let all quarters bow... as the moon ascends the sky!",
+  "FavorWord_131150_Title": "Resonance Liberation: I",
+  "FavorWord_131151_Content": "By Sentinel's decree... formations, arise.",
+  "FavorWord_131151_Title": "Resonance Liberation: II",
+  "FavorWord_131152_Content": "At my coming, worlds arise.",
+  "FavorWord_131152_Title": "Resonance Liberation: III",
+  "FavorWord_131153_Content": "Within this domain, I am the law.",
+  "FavorWord_131153_Title": "Resonance Liberation: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131154_Content": "Cities rise, infinite worlds tear",
+  "FavorWord_131154_Title": "Resonance Liberation: V",
+  "FavorWord_131155_Content": "All forms return to ruin!",
+  "FavorWord_131155_Title": "Resonance Liberation: VI",
+  "FavorWord_131156_Content": "Don't be so hasty.",
+  "FavorWord_131156_Title": "Dodge",
+  "FavorWord_131157_Content": "A hair's breath.",
+  "FavorWord_131157_Title": "Dodge Counter",
+  "FavorWord_131158_Content": "Insolence...",
+  "FavorWord_131158_Title": "Hit: I",
+  "FavorWord_131159_Content": "...Not without skill.",
+  "FavorWord_131159_Title": "Hit: II",
+  "FavorWord_131160_Content": "Oh dear, my hairpins!",
+  "FavorWord_131160_Title": "Injured: I",
+  "FavorWord_131161_Content": "A third of my power... is more than enough.",
+  "FavorWord_131161_Title": "Injured: II",
+  "FavorWord_131162_Content": "This heart will not waver...",
+  "FavorWord_131162_Title": "Fallen: I",
+  "FavorWord_131163_Content": "I have... failed you...",
+  "FavorWord_131163_Title": "Fallen: II",
+  "FavorWord_131164_Content": "Arbiter... farewell...",
+  "FavorWord_131164_Title": "Fallen: III",
+  "FavorWord_131165_Content": "Come forth, little one.",
+  "FavorWord_131165_Title": "Echo Summon",
+  "FavorWord_131166_Content": "Not merely a fox.",
+  "FavorWord_131166_Title": "Echo Transform",
+  "FavorWord_131167_Content": "What a generous reception.",
+  "FavorWord_131167_Title": "Enemies Near",
+  "FavorWord_131168_Content": "...Nothing compares to this mortal world.",
+  "FavorWord_131168_Title": "Glide",
+  "FavorWord_131169_Content": "See? There's no hiding from me.",
+  "FavorWord_131169_Title": "Scan",
+  "FavorWord_131170_Content": "Fancy yourself able to keep up?",
+  "FavorWord_131170_Title": "Dash",
+  "FavorWord_131171_Content": "Oh, this one's a treasure.",
+  "FavorWord_131171_Title": "Supply Chest: I",
+  "FavorWord_131172_Content": "This land knows to treat us well.",
+  "FavorWord_131172_Title": "Supply Chest: II",
+  "FavorWord_131173_Content": "Does this please you?",
+  "FavorWord_131173_Title": "Supply Chest: III",
+  "FavorWord_131174_Content": "Nexus turns, stars sink.",
+  "FavorWord_131174_Title": "Intro Skill: I",
+  "FavorWord_131175_Content": "One will, infinite forms.",
+  "FavorWord_131175_Title": "Intro Skill: II",
+  "FavorWord_131201_Content": "For a century, the <te href=260002>Ministry of Sentinel Affairs</te> has spoken on behalf of Hsin the Moon Fox to every <te href=850084>Magistrate</te>. It has held the line, generation after generation, through every crisis <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te> has faced. I deeply respect that. Now, with you, the Arbiter, aiding Hsin the Moon Fox in fulfilling Her grand cause, the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> has returned. Remnants of the threat remain, but Mengzhou's future now holds promise.",
+  "FavorWord_131201_Title": "Thoughts: I",
+  "FavorWord_131202_Content": "Beyond <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> affairs, the Ministry also handles astronomy and the calendar. Each city's branch has its own duties, and here in <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>, we—Ahem... Pardon me. You mentioned you weren't very familiar with the Ministry's responsibilities, and I've let myself ramble. In short, we serve the Sentinel. So, Arbiter, if you have need of anything, regardless of what it is, I will see to it.",
+  "FavorWord_131202_Title": "Thoughts: II",
+  "FavorWord_131203_Content": "At Sentinel Hsin's behest, I joined the <te href=260002>Ministry</te> to purge Balanophora's remnants, restore order, and find a path forward. When I first read of the \"Arbiter\" in the <te href=850117>Grand Library</te>, I wondered what kind of person could guide a <te href=850083>Sentinel</te>. Meeting you today... I can tell that you truly live up to your title.",
+  "FavorWord_131203_Title": "Thoughts: III",
+  "FavorWord_131204_Content": "The members of the Ten Seals Covenant were all bound by their obsessions—for a vow, for family, or for me. They said they were drawn to me. That they would follow wherever I led. But... it was their refusal to yield, their unrelenting drive toward what they wanted, that moved me and pushed me forward. Arbiter... you, too, have that effect on me.",
+  "FavorWord_131204_Title": "Thoughts: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131205_Content": "Arbiter, if you stood where I did back then, what would you have chosen? Your homeland ravaged, completely alone. Facing it head-on might buy a glimpse of hope, but at the cost of your friends' lives. Apologies. Forget I asked. It's just... I've never been able to let it go. And I just knew you would understand. I just... needed to say it out loud.",
+  "FavorWord_131205_Title": "Thoughts: V",
+  "FavorWord_131206_Content": "Rain clouds gather in the afternoon. A cool breeze, a light drizzle against the eaves… I sit by the window listening, dusting the Vermillion Locks. A somber scene, I know... and yet, I find I quite like it.",
+  "FavorWord_131206_Title": "Suoming's Hobby",
+  "FavorWord_131207_Content": "As for my major concerns, they are the future of <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te> and Balanophora's whereabouts. Beyond that... I cannot say if it's just my imagination, but ever since Sentinel Hsin returned, Mengzhou seems to have more sunny days. My eyes have always been sensitive to light, so this has become a bit of a personal grievance.",
+  "FavorWord_131207_Title": "Suoming's Trouble",
+  "FavorWord_131208_Content": "The Huating of the past was mired in hardships. Resources were scarce, and fine cuisine a distant dream. The only exception was the local white tea. Truly exceptional. Even now, at the <te href=260002>Ministry</te>, I often find myself craving it. Every time I drink it, I think of them. As if that chapter of my life... is steeped in the color of the tea.",
+  "FavorWord_131208_Title": "Favorite Food",
+  "FavorWord_131209_Content": "There is nothing I truly dislike. But ever since I mentioned, rather casually, that bitter things do not agree with me, sweets began to appear on my desk with some regularity. I've even heard them call it \"feeding the beast.\" Heh... Youthful antics. I let them have their fun.",
+  "FavorWord_131209_Title": "Disliked Food",
+  "FavorWord_131210_Content": "I've always dreamed of returning to Huating one day to live in a small cottage. If I am needed, I will help. If not, I will simply watch the world go by in peace, alongside Ninth and the others. That would be enough for me. But of course, that is still a long way off. For now, Hsin and <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>'s future must come first.",
+  "FavorWord_131210_Title": "Ideals",
+  "FavorWord_131211_Content": "\"If we fall, Seal Master, lock our frequencies away.\" Knowing my Forte, that was what they asked of me. I didn't refuse. Together with the Second Seal, we forged the Vermillion Locks. When the work was done, the others gathered around, laughing—praising the Second Seal's craftsmanship, remarking on how the color suited me. They treated them like mere keepsakes, rather than vessels for their final rest. The least I can do now... is not waste what they gave me.",
+  "FavorWord_131211_Title": "Chat: I",
+  "FavorWord_131212_Content": "My past? Mm... it's been ages since I last spoke of it. Very well, then. I will share it with you one rainy day.",
+  "FavorWord_131212_Title": "Chat: II",
+  "FavorWord_131213_Content": "After our bitter victory over the Evil Miasma, I resented the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> for failing to appear while the black rain fell upon Huating. But when I finally stood before It, seeing <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te> as it was and finding It gravely wounded yet still straining to hold the enemies at bay... How could I hold onto my hatred? In the end, I accepted the <te href=260002>Ministry of Sentinel Affairs</te>' mandate and dedicated everything I have to It and to Mengzhou.",
+  "FavorWord_131213_Title": "About Hsin the Moon Fox",
+  "FavorWord_131214_Content": "If we speak of age, Hsin is actually a bit younger than me. Having assisted the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> for so long, watching Her grow into who She is today naturally carries a certain fondness. Whether it was Her solitary effort to remold the <te href=800053>Civilization Capsule</te> in the past, or Her finally stepping into Her role as the Sentinel now... Hsin has never once let the Sentinel down.",
+  "FavorWord_131214_Title": "About Hsin",
+  "FavorWord_131215_Content": "When I took up the Intendant's mantle, the <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> and I made a pact: It would find the root of the Evil Miasma's spawning, and I would end it with my own hands. Now that I know it all stems from Balanophora's wounding of the Sentinel... her fate is sealed.",
+  "FavorWord_131215_Title": "About Balanophora",
+  "FavorWord_131216_Content": "She was a pitiful child. The Evil Miasma had left her stealing food on the streets, and out of all people, I was the one who discovered her ability to turn invisible. (Sigh) If I were to start talking about how she might've lived longer if she'd never met me, she'd only be upset... How I wish to hear her calling me Sister Suoming again.",
+  "FavorWord_131216_Title": "About Ninth",
+  "FavorWord_131217_Content": "I was wondering what blessing would be fitting for an Intendant to offer the Arbiter. In the end, I realized that words from the heart are what matters most on this special day.\nSo, happy birthday, Arbiter. The <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te> <te href=260002>Ministry of Sentinel Affairs</te> will always have your back. May all be well in Hsin's keeping, and may your journey ahead be safe.",
+  "FavorWord_131217_Title": "Birthday Wishes",
+  "FavorWord_131218_Content": "Ninth Seal: Sister Suoming!\nSuoming: Mm.\nNinth Seal: Whoa!\nSuoming: Look.\nSuoming: Mm...",
+  "FavorWord_131218_Title": "Idle: I",
+  "FavorWord_131219_Content": "(Effort Sound)",
+  "FavorWord_131219_Title": "Idle: II",
+  "FavorWord_131220_Content": "Hm? You don't even think to call me Seal Master? Hehe, just kidding.",
+  "FavorWord_131220_Title": "Idle: III",
+  "FavorWord_131221_Content": "Suoming, Seal Master of the Ten Seals Covenant, and Intendant of <te href=850154>Mengzhou</te>'s <te href=260002>Ministry of Sentinel Affairs</te>. Any enemy of Mengzhou is an enemy of mine.",
+  "FavorWord_131221_Title": "Self-Introduction",
+  "FavorWord_131222_Content": "When the Blight Rain and Miasmic Thunder fade, what remains is only... locked obsessions.",
+  "FavorWord_131222_Title": "Greeting",
+  "FavorWord_131223_Content": "To battle? Alright. May all be well in Hsin's keeping.",
+  "FavorWord_131223_Title": "Join Team: I",
+  "FavorWord_131224_Content": "Mm, let's begin.",
+  "FavorWord_131224_Title": "Join Team: II",
+  "FavorWord_131225_Content": "Nine Shadows... Ready to strike.",
+  "FavorWord_131225_Title": "Join Team: III",
+  "FavorWord_131226_Content": "I'd almost forgotten this feeling of being honed.",
+  "FavorWord_131226_Title": "Ascension: I",
+  "FavorWord_131227_Content": "Each form of the Nine Shadows demanded rigorous practice to master. Ah, those old training days are coming back to me.",
+  "FavorWord_131227_Title": "Ascension: II",
+  "FavorWord_131228_Content": "The Third Seal taught me the sword. The Seventh, the spear. And now, you've left your mark on me as well.",
+  "FavorWord_131228_Title": "Ascension: III",
+  "FavorWord_131229_Content": "This is… the quiet at the center. Arbiter, for a breath, the weight of my obsessions lifted. But only for a moment.",
+  "FavorWord_131229_Title": "Ascension: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131230_Content": "I know the Ten Seals Covenant fell to the Evil Miasma, but I still carry the guilt. It was my weakness that led to that tragedy. I will never let history repeat itself.",
+  "FavorWord_131230_Title": "Ascension: V",
+  "FavorWord_131231_Content": "Threefold shatter.",
+  "FavorWord_131231_Title": "Basic Attack: I",
+  "FavorWord_131232_Content": "Scatter!",
+  "FavorWord_131232_Title": "Basic Attack: II",
+  "FavorWord_131233_Content": "Fivefold sever.",
+  "FavorWord_131233_Title": "Basic Attack: III",
+  "FavorWord_131234_Content": "Sevenfold flash!",
+  "FavorWord_131234_Title": "Basic Attack: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131235_Content": "Sixfold collapse!",
+  "FavorWord_131235_Title": "Basic Attack: V",
+  "FavorWord_131236_Content": "Eightfold sweep.",
+  "FavorWord_131236_Title": "Heavy Attack: I",
+  "FavorWord_131237_Content": "Whirling rend!",
+  "FavorWord_131237_Title": "Heavy Attack: II",
+  "FavorWord_131238_Content": "Nine Shadows!",
+  "FavorWord_131238_Title": "Heavy Attack: III",
+  "FavorWord_131239_Content": "Nine—Shadows!",
+  "FavorWord_131239_Title": "Heavy Attack: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131240_Content": "Metal Canopy, full unleash!",
+  "FavorWord_131240_Title": "Heavy Attack: V",
+  "FavorWord_131241_Content": "Twofold descent!",
+  "FavorWord_131241_Title": "Aerial Attack",
+  "FavorWord_131242_Content": "Onefold tremor.",
+  "FavorWord_131242_Title": "Resonance Skill: I",
+  "FavorWord_131243_Content": "Fourfold cut.",
+  "FavorWord_131243_Title": "Resonance Skill: II",
+  "FavorWord_131244_Content": "Ending...",
+  "FavorWord_131244_Title": "Resonance Skill: III",
+  "FavorWord_131245_Content": "Thunder...",
+  "FavorWord_131245_Title": "Resonance Skill: IV",
+  "FavorWord_131246_Content": "Thundering peaks, seal evil rain!",
+  "FavorWord_131246_Title": "Resonance Liberation: I",
+  "FavorWord_131247_Content": "Step into... the Blight Rain.",
+  "FavorWord_131247_Title": "Resonance Liberation: II",
+  "FavorWord_131248_Content": "Hmph. Nine Shadows... Unfold!",
+  "FavorWord_131248_Title": "Resonance Liberation: III",
+  "FavorWord_131249_Content": "I stake myself!",
+  "FavorWord_131249_Title": "Intro Skill: I",
+  "FavorWord_131250_Content": "Seals aligned!",
+  "FavorWord_131250_Title": "Intro Skill: II",
+  "FavorWord_131251_Content": "Vermillion Lock, release!",
+  "FavorWord_131251_Title": "Intro Skill: III",
+  "FavorWord_131252_Content": "Too easy.",
+  "FavorWord_131252_Title": "Dodge",
+  "FavorWord_131253_Content": "Caught!",
+  "FavorWord_131253_Title": "Counterattack",
+  "FavorWord_131254_Content": "Sundering bloom!",
+  "FavorWord_131254_Title": "Dodge Counter",
+  "FavorWord_131255_Content": "Tch.",
+  "FavorWord_131255_Title": "Hit: I",
+  "FavorWord_131256_Content": "I slipped?",
+  "FavorWord_131256_Title": "Hit: II",
+  "FavorWord_131257_Content": "A mere smudge on the hem.",
+  "FavorWord_131257_Title": "Injured: I",
+  "FavorWord_131258_Content": "Hahh... Need to be cautious.",
+  "FavorWord_131258_Title": "Injured: II",
+  "FavorWord_131259_Content": "I will not repeat history...",
+  "FavorWord_131259_Title": "Injured: III",
+  "FavorWord_131260_Content": "Finally... I'll see you all again.",
+  "FavorWord_131260_Title": "Fallen: I",
+  "FavorWord_131261_Content": "Our journey ends here...",
+  "FavorWord_131261_Title": "Fallen: II",
+  "FavorWord_131262_Content": "The rain... has it stopped?",
+  "FavorWord_131262_Title": "Fallen: III",
+  "FavorWord_131263_Content": "Fight with me.",
+  "FavorWord_131263_Title": "Echo Summon",
+  "FavorWord_131264_Content": "Myriad forms.",
+  "FavorWord_131264_Title": "Echo Transform",
+  "FavorWord_131265_Content": "Canopy out, I'll take it from here.",
+  "FavorWord_131265_Title": "Enemies Near",
+  "FavorWord_131266_Content": "On the wind, I fall.",
+  "FavorWord_131266_Title": "Glider",
+  "FavorWord_131267_Content": "Sighted.",
+  "FavorWord_131267_Title": "Sensor",
+  "FavorWord_131268_Content": "Hurry up.",
+  "FavorWord_131268_Title": "Dash",
+  "FavorWord_131269_Content": "A worthy harvest.",
+  "FavorWord_131269_Title": "Supply Chest: I",
+  "FavorWord_131270_Content": "Ninth would love these.",
+  "FavorWord_131270_Title": "Supply Chest: II",
+  "FavorWord_131271_Content": "Mm, you'll have use for this.",
+  "FavorWord_131271_Title": "Supply Chest: III",
   "FavorWord_140201_Content": "If anything feels unfamiliar or unaccommodating, you can always ask me for help, Rover. This isn't only because you are our guest. It's just... you have no memory or any friends here in <te href=850091>Jinzhou</te>. I think there might be moments when you'd need me.",
   "FavorWord_140201_Title": "Thoughts: I",
   "FavorWord_140202_Content": "Since I became an <te href=850139>Outrider</te>, I've met people from all walks of life in the wild. Some always seemed in such haste, yet remained unsure where they were heading, and often ended up lost. On the other hand, those who had a clear destination in mind usually did make it, despite arduous roads and occasional stumbles. I aspire to be one of the latter, and leaving home for Jinzhou was the first step I took.",
@@ -63570,7 +64037,7 @@
   "FavorWord_141303_Title": "Thoughts: III",
   "FavorWord_141304_Content": "Recognize this stance? Yes, it is the one I always used before I sought the path of cultivation, the very reason I first took up the sword. Our next duel will not be a contest of Fortes, but of swordplay and clarity of mind. The loser shall sweep every fallen leaf from the training hall's gates. Now, my disciple... receive this strike.",
   "FavorWord_141304_Title": "Thoughts: IV",
-  "FavorWord_141305_Content": "Disciple, I know the <te href=270001>Xuanfang</te> is merely a fleeting stop on your long journey, and the day you depart will come. The time we shared here has been precious. Months, years—perhaps a century, as before—may pass before we meet again. Well... I know not when that day will come. Only that it shall. When it does, we need only tell our journeys through our swords. A single clash of our Sword Intent will say more than a thousand words ever could.",
+  "FavorWord_141305_Content": "My disciple, I know <te href=270001>Xuanfang</te> is merely a fleeting stop on your long journey, and the day you depart will come. The time we shared here has been precious. Months, years—perhaps a century, as before—may pass before we meet again. Well... I know not when that day will come. Only that it shall. When it does, we need only tell our journeys through our swords. A single clash of our Sword Intent will say more than a thousand words ever could.",
   "FavorWord_141305_Title": "Thoughts: V",
   "FavorWord_141306_Content": "Outside of cultivation, I often spend time setting down my memories and reflections. And since mastering the art of Midair Calligraphy, I rarely use paper and ink. Instead, I channel my Sword Energy to carve the past into my <te href=800052>inner landscape</te>. What is etched there endures. Everything fades in time, like morning mist, but as long as someone remembers, they never truly vanish.",
   "FavorWord_141306_Title": "Qingxiao's Hobby",
@@ -63582,11 +64049,11 @@
   "FavorWord_141309_Title": "Disliked Food",
   "FavorWord_141310_Content": "To attain the Way and transcend...? That is the peak most Cultivators strive for. I was no different, once. Yet the Way is boundless. Scale one great mountain, and another waits beyond it. We are all but travelers on this path. Some have merely walked a little further than others. Now, I hone my sword and my spirit for one reason alone... inner peace.",
   "FavorWord_141310_Title": "Ideals",
-  "FavorWord_141311_Content": "When I first studied under my master, I struggled to quiet my mind. Instead of telling her, I began wearing silk ribbons said to possess calming properties. They worked. As my training progressed, I removed them one by one, leaving only the ribbon on my left wrist. Later, I learned Master had known all along. She told me the ribbons held no special power. It was the faith I placed in them that granted me confidence and fewer stray thoughts. I still wear it now as a reminder that cultivation is, above all, being true.",
+  "FavorWord_141311_Content": "When I first studied under my master, I struggled to quiet my mind. Instead of telling her, I began wearing silk ribbons said to possess calming properties. They worked. As my training progressed, I removed them one by one, leaving only the ribbon on my left wrist. Later, I learned Master had known all along. She told me the ribbons held no special power. It was the faith I placed in them that granted me confidence and fewer stray thoughts. I still wear it now as a reminder that cultivation is, above all, about being true.",
   "FavorWord_141311_Title": "Chat: I",
   "FavorWord_141312_Content": "During these years in <te href=270001>Xuanfang</te>, I would occasionally descend the mountain to aid the locals. Over time, rumors about me spread. Most are wildly exaggerated. Some revere me as a Transcendent, lighting incense as an offering to me in their homes, while others view the Xuan Paragon as all-powerful. I denied them at first, but eventually, I just let them be. After all, the belief that a Transcendent watches over Xuanfang brings people the comfort they need.",
   "FavorWord_141312_Title": "Chat: II",
-  "FavorWord_141313_Content": "Hsin is one to follow Her whims, and carries a wealth of emotions unlike any other <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> of <te href=850093>Huanglong</te>. It was She who first invited me to hold the honorary title of Xuan Paragon in Xuanfang Hold. In those days, She would often come up the mountain, regaling me with anecdotes and trivia, and once She started, She could go on for hours. Only when I played the qin would She fall quiet. Sometimes, as She listened, a flicker of loneliness would cross Her face… She always believed She hid it well from me.",
+  "FavorWord_141313_Content": "Hsin is one to follow Her whims, and carries a wealth of emotions unlike any other <te href=850083>Sentinel</te> of <te href=850093>Huanglong</te>. It was She who first invited me to hold the honorary title of Xuan Paragon in Xuanfang Hold. In those days, She would often come up the mountain, regaling me with local anecdotes and trivia, and once She started, She could go on for hours. Only when I played the qin would She fall quiet. Sometimes, as She listened, a flicker of loneliness would cross Her face… She always believed She hid it well from me.",
   "FavorWord_141313_Title": "About Hsin",
   "FavorWord_141314_Content": "The flame she manipulates is indeed a rare and perilous force. My Quietude Art could only ease the burning pain it caused her. To avoid being consumed by it, she had to temper her mind and master the flow of her Forte. The life she had already burned away cannot be restored. But now that she can wield it freely, she should be fine, so long as she respects her limits. That, too, is thanks to you.",
   "FavorWord_141314_Title": "About Changli",
@@ -63728,6 +64195,8 @@
