   "GuideTutorialPage_3400101_Content": "After interacting with Corroders nearby, the <color=#ffd12f>Corroders</color> will temporarily <color=#ffd12f>follow</color> you.\nBring them <color=#ffd12f>close to Spikes</color>, and they will dissolve the golden pillar to the side, eventually dissolving the Spikes.",
   "GuideTutorialPage_34001_Content": "In the wild, where Tacetite clusters develop freely, sometimes <color=#ffd12f>Spikes</color> can be found blocking the path or <color=#ffd12f>sealing off</color> items or puzzles.\nLook closely around the Spikes for <color=#ffd12f>Corroders</color>. They will dissolve the Spikes.",
