-  "GuideTutorialPage_34319_Content": "Sword Flight Windpaths can be found throughout the Land of Xuanfang.\n<color=#ffd12f>Hold</color> the interact button at the start of the Sword Flight Windpath to fly on your sword.\nMost Windpaths are near Meditation Spots, making exploration much faster. Take to the skies on your sword and soar across the horizon.",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_3432002_Content": "When all <color=#ffd12f>related Mechanism Controls</color> are overloaded, the mechanism barrier on the Cloud Shuttle can be removed.",
