+  "GuideTutorialPage_34318_Content": "\"Will and sword as one, that the edge follows your heart.\"\n<color=#ffd12f>Hold</color> the interact button at the start of the Sword Flight Windpath to fly on your sword.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_34319_Content": "Sword Flight Windpaths can be found throughout the Land of Xuanfang.\n<color=#ffd12f>Hold</color> the interact button at the start of the Sword Flight Windpath to fly on your sword.\nMost Windpaths are near Meditation Spots, so make good use of them while exploring. Take to the skies on your sword and soar across the horizon.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_3432002_Content": "When all <color=#ffd12f>related Mechanism Controls</color> are overloaded at once, the mechanism barrier on the Cloud Shuttle can be removed.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_34320_Content": "Most Cloud Shuttle mechanisms use control devices called Mechanism Controls.\nWhen near one, <color=#ffd12f>strike its core with Flying Swords</color> to overload it, much like striking the eye of a formation.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_34321_Content": "Reeling Fog corrupts nearby Mechanism Controls, turning mechanism barriers into fog walls...\nDestroy all linked controls using Flying Swords to overload them at once and clear the fog.",
