   "GuideTutorialPage_3612004_Content": "The following Resonators are enhanced in the Adversity Vanguard Challenge Cycle of Endstate Matrix:\nJiyan, Yinlin, Jinhsi, Changli, Zhezhi, Xiangli Yao, Camellya, Carlotta, Roccia, Phoebe, Brant, Cantarella.",
   "GuideTutorialPage_36120_Content": "In the Endstate Matrix: Adversity Vanguard Challenge Cycle, the Score Multiplier increases with each Round. The specific multipliers are as follows:\nRound 1: Score Multiplier x1.00\nRound 2: Score Multiplier x1.15\nRound 3: Score Multiplier x1.25",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_3612102_Content": "Collect Resonance Factors to boost your combat power or change skill forms.\nResonance Factors that change skill forms are unique, and only one can be applied per skill. Factors that do not change skill forms provide passive boosts and can be stacked.",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_3612103_Content": "Dodge has no default Stagnation effect. Instead, its effect changes based on your acquired Dodge Resonance Factors.",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_3612104_Content": "In every simulation, Rover has a limited number of Revivals.\nIf Rover's HP drops to zero while unused Revivals remain, HP will be restored by a set percentage. If all Revivals have been exhausted, the simulation fails.",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_36121_Content": "You can enter the Resonance Sim Realm only as Rover. Rover possesses five skills: Basic Attack, Heavy Attack, Resonance Skill, Dodge, and Morph Skill.",
-  "GuideTutorialPage_36122_Content": "Rehearsing before a performance helps you engage in the rhythm better.\nInteract with the <color=#ffd12f>highlighted keys</color> in sequence to practice a short melody.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_3612102_Content": "Collect Resonance Factors to boost your combat power or change skill forms.\nEach skill can have only one form-changing Resonance Factor at a time. Factors that do not change skill forms provide passive boosts and can be stacked.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_3612103_Content": "Dodge no longer has a default Stagnation effect. Instead, its effect changes based on your acquired Dodge Resonance Factors.",
+  "GuideTutorialPage_3612104_Content": "In every simulation, Rover has a limited number of Revive attempts.\nIf Rover's HP drops to zero while unused Revive attempts remain, HP will be restored by a set percentage. If all attempts have been exhausted, the simulation fails.",
