+  "HelpText_678_Content": "Cubie Wars Progress Saving\n1. During a Stage, you can save your current progress and exit from the pause screen.\n2. After exiting, you can continue the challenge from the saved progress at the Stage page.\n3. Saves of different Stages are independent of each other and reset after each version update.",
+  "HelpText_678_Title": "Cubie Wars Progress Saving",
   "HelpText_679_Content": "[About]\nA brand-new version of Second Coming of Solaris like you've never seen is coming soon! What are you waiting for? Come give it a try!\n\n[Eligibility]\nReach Union Level 14.\n\n[Event Rules]\nCertain anomalies can be found in the game scenes. After locating these anomalies, use the Utility: Zoom Camera to capture them, then work with Bertolt to modify them.\nYou may choose to mark these anomalies or intentionally distort them further. The choices you make will determine how players of The Second Coming of Solaris test server rate this scene after all anomalies have been handled.",
   "HelpText_679_Title": "Second Coming of Solaris: Coded Deception",
   "HelpText_67_Content": "[Eligibility]\nReach Union Level 8.\n\n[Event Details]\nComplete the following three quests to obtain corresponding rewards.\n1. Search for and absorb specific Echoes. Tap the image to navigate to Echo Collection to track the target.\n2. Data Bank level reaches 10. Unlock new Echoes or higher rarity of existing Echoes to obtain Data Bank EXP.\n3. Complete quests of \"Silver-haired Echo Trainer\" series.",
   "HelpText_67_Title": "Echo Hunters",
   "HelpText_680_Content": "Stay tuned",
   "HelpText_680_Title": "Stay tuned",
