+  "HelpText_681_Title": "",
+  "HelpText_682_Content": "Cubie Wars Collection\n1. Unlocking Items: The first time you synthesize a locked Item in a match, that Item is unlocked and added to the Collection.\n2. Roles Filter: You can filter the list by Adventure Roles to find Items for a specific Role.\n3. Roles Guide: The Roles Guide page shows recommended builds, core Items, and endgame lineups for each Role.",
+  "HelpText_682_Title": "Cubie Wars Collection",
+  "HelpText_689_Content": "test/ Cubie Wars illustrated tutorial description",
+  "HelpText_689_Title": "test/ Cubie Wars illustrated tutorial",
+  "HelpText_691_Content": "[About]\nFollowing the resolution of anomalies of the Simulacrum Nexus, a mysterious girl sends you a WavesLine message, claiming she \"has a favor to ask.\" As the matter unfolds, a story about Hsin the Moon Fox, the past Sentinel, comes to light.\n\n[Eligibility]\nReach Union Level 14 and complete the Main Quest \"Simulacrum of the Heart: Epilogue.\"\n\n[Event Rules]\nComplete the Tales Quest \"Moonlike Heart, Mortal Longing\" to claim the quest rewards. The event will close after Version 3.7 ends. In versions after 3.7, Rovers meeting the quest unlock conditions can still accept and complete this quest from the quest page to claim its rewards.",
+  "HelpText_691_Title": "Moonlike Heart, Mortal Longing",
+  "HelpText_694_Content": "Replay Mode\n1. You can replay any Main Quest you've already completed using Replay Mode.\n2. Your progress is automatically saved when you exit Replay Mode. You can resume from where you left off in the Journey Log, or reset your progress manually.\n3. You'll have a separate Backpack while in Replay Mode. Items obtained during Replay Mode only exist there and won't carry over.\n4. Some features are unavailable while in Replay Mode.",
+  "HelpText_694_Title": "Replay Mode",
   "HelpText_69_Content": "1. Some Resonators have special Companion Stories, through which you get to learn all the intimate details of them.\n2. Companion Stories are unlocked when certain requirements are met. You can claim abundant rewards after completing them.",
   "HelpText_69_Title": "Companion Stories",
