+  "ItemInfo_42601630_BgDescription": "Legend has it that the Divine Fox once spent all Her divine power and became bound to the mortal world, all to light Mengzhou's endless night. In commemoration, people inscribe the year's blessings upon Moon Lanterns and set them adrift as invitations, bidding the mirth-loving Divine Fox to share in mortal joys. The Bloom of Hearkening is said to have taken shape from the divine power She left behind, and thus resonates with the emotions of all living things: it wilts in sorrow, blushes in joy, and bursts open in wrath. Seeing it as an incarnate of the Divine Fox Herself, people often confide their hearts to it.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601630_Name": "Bloom of Hearkening",
+  "ItemInfo_42601630_ObtainedShowDescription": "The Bloom of Hearkening is said to have taken shape from the power the Divine Fox left behind and thus resonates with the various emotions of all living things. Seeing it as an incarnate of the Divine Fox Herself, people often confide their hearts to it.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601640_AttributesDescription": "A material used for Resonator Ascension.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601640_BgDescription": "Originally a common tree of Mengzhou, it was corrupted by the Evil Miasma's Miasmic Thunder and reduced to a charred, blackened stump, upon which red lightning can still be seen darting. Though the Huaxu Academy and the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs have confirmed it poses no immediate danger, its contamination by the Evil Miasma has made it a scar upon the land, and few dare approach. Whether it is the remains of the Evil Miasma or the breeding ground of a new calamity has yet to be determined.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601640_Name": "Miasmic Branch",
+  "ItemInfo_42601640_ObtainedShowDescription": "Originally a common tree of Mengzhou, it was corrupted by the Evil Miasma and reduced to a Miasmic Branch. The Miasmic Thunder that split it still lingers within.",
