   "LoadingTipsText_613001_Title": "Shadowforged Court: Condensed Frequencies",
   "LoadingTipsText_613101_TipsText": "To help Solaris prepare for future crises, the Black Shores and Spacetrek Collective have launched a new hologram simulation project. At Yhoran’s invitation, you and your companions step up to take part, ready to fight for humanity's survival in a simulated doomsday.",
   "LoadingTipsText_613101_Title": "Lament Recon: Tacet Crisis",
-  "LoadingTipsText_613201_TipsText": "The skies darken and storms rage. \nMalfunctioning mechanical components fill the entire space. All before your eyes is spiraling into chaos and disorder...",
+  "LoadingTipsText_613201_TipsText": "The skies darken, and storms rage. \nMalfunctioning mechanical components fill the entire space. All before your eyes is spiraling into chaos and disorder...",
   "LoadingTipsText_613201_Title": "Tian Realm",
-  "LoadingTipsText_613301_TipsText": "A bright moon hangs in the clear night sky. Shadows dance amid a lingering fragrance. The beloved is by my side.\nHer heartscape now laid bare before you.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_613301_TipsText": "A bright moon hangs in the clear night sky. Shadows dance amid a lingering fragrance. The beloved is by my side.\nHer heartscape is now laid bare before you.",
   "LoadingTipsText_613301_Title": "Inner Landscape: Heart Lake",
   "LoadingTipsText_613401_TipsText": "Within the Sanctum, the mist swirls. The signs were there all along...",
   "LoadingTipsText_613401_Title": "Manifold Sanctum",
   "LoadingTipsText_613501_TipsText": "The mountain gate towers into the heavens, vanishing among the clouds. Every brick and tile is shaped by human hands. \nIn those days, Yuan Fortress stood astride the major routes of Xuanfang, a vital frontier stronghold that kept Tacet Discords from reaching the heartland of Mengzhou.",
-  "LoadingTipsText_613501_Title": "Outside Yuan Fortress",
+  "LoadingTipsText_613501_Title": "Yuan Fortress Entrance",
   "LoadingTipsText_613601_TipsText": "Sword shadows fade, yet the heartstrings remain entangled.\nLingering attachments left unsevered, unfinished ties of fate—these have already become shackles.",
   "LoadingTipsText_613601_Title": "Strings of Ruffled Dreams",
   "LoadingTipsText_613701_TipsText": "Stay tuned",
   "LoadingTipsText_613701_Title": "Stay tuned",
-  "LoadingTipsText_613801_TipsText": "",
-  "LoadingTipsText_613801_Title": "",
+  "LoadingTipsText_613801_TipsText": "On this stage, the Cubie Warriors will make use of magical items to wage a fierce battle!",
+  "LoadingTipsText_613801_Title": "Cubie Wars",
   "LoadingTipsText_613901_TipsText": "Stay tuned",
   "LoadingTipsText_613901_Title": "Stay tuned",
   "LoadingTipsText_614001_TipsText": "Stay tuned",
   "LoadingTipsText_614001_Title": "Stay tuned",
-  "LoadingTipsText_614101_TipsText": "Stay tuned",
-  "LoadingTipsText_614101_Title": "Stay tuned",
   "LoadingTipsText_80020101_TipsText": "A mysterious gateway has appeared, leading to a realm known as Somnoire. Legend has it that it hosts the dreams of all beings in Solaris...",
   "LoadingTipsText_80020101_Title": "Somnoire, the Illusive Realm",
   "LoadingTipsText_900101_TipsText": "In broad daylight, Daemons once devoured in a great fire whisper through the streets of Ragunna. They wield beloved poetry and music as weapons of their curse. A confrontation, wrapped in the language of art, begins to unfold on the stage of Rinascita.\nRemnants of past sins resurge. From deep beneath the earth, they scheme and plot. When the flames that once ripped through the night return, a silent war will begin.",
@@ -164324,8 +165252,10 @@
   "LoadingTipsText_901101_Title": "At Dream's Edge",
   "LoadingTipsText_901201_TipsText": "As mechanisms shift, echoes persist without end. The wind carries new tidings, and with them, a long-awaited reunion.\nWhen the blade falls, the skylark sheds its first feather. Guided by song, the girl steps through her dreams, toward a destiny no longer at a standstill.",
   "LoadingTipsText_901201_Title": "Blade of Past Resounds, Lingering Dream Hymns",
-  "LoadingTipsText_901301_TipsText": "",
+  "LoadingTipsText_901301_TipsText": "Mist and cloud stretch far. The vast sky races past.\nAmid the looming mirages, a Fire of Life shines into dark and light alike, and burns delusion away. Down the long road of transcendence, a jade blade carries the light of the mortal world, and proves a heart set on the Way.\nHeaven keeps its indifferent course, and the mortal world is small and fragile. But if this heart does not waver, the flame may yet be passed down a hundred generations, unending.",
   "LoadingTipsText_901301_Title": "Lamplight in Mirage, Sword's Resolve in Heart",
+  "LoadingTipsText_901401_TipsText": "",
+  "LoadingTipsText_901401_Title": "",
   "LoadingTipsText_920101_TipsText": "The Priestesses have forgotten. Augusta has forgotten... Even though the world has forgotten, you remember Iuno. After all, you see her once again.\nWith her bracelet and the moonlight to guide you, you walk on. You don't know where the path leads, only that you must keep going, until the moonlight finally falls.",
   "LoadingTipsText_920101_Title": "Where Moonlight Falls",
   "LoadingTipsText_920201_TipsText": "Humble and unadorned, this place offers a transitory respite in the looping Lament.",
@@ -164406,14 +165336,14 @@
   "LoadingTipsText_924401_Title": "Silent Snow",
   "LoadingTipsText_924601_TipsText": "Mountains and rivers unfold like a painting. White clouds drift by like a fleeting dream. \nThe Cloud Shuttles that sail these skies seem destined never to rest.",
   "LoadingTipsText_924601_Title": "Ren Realm",
-  "LoadingTipsText_924701_TipsText": "At this very moment, the situation within the real Xuanfang Hold seems to have shifted...",
-  "LoadingTipsText_924701_Title": "Xuanfang Hold at This Moment",
-  "LoadingTipsText_924801_TipsText": "Dark clouds gather; a heavy fog blankets the land. \nThe higher one climbs toward the heavens, the deeper one plunges into the abyss.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_924701_TipsText": "At this very moment, things within the real Xuanfang Hold seem to have changed...",
+  "LoadingTipsText_924701_Title": "Xuanfang Hold: Present",
+  "LoadingTipsText_924801_TipsText": "Dark clouds gather. A heavy fog blankets the land. \nThe higher one climbs toward the heavens, the deeper one plunges into the abyss.",
   "LoadingTipsText_924801_Title": "Di Realm",
   "LoadingTipsText_924901_TipsText": "Amid the mist, within the secluded pagoda, anomalies spread. The Moon Fox leaves only mysteries in Her wake.",
   "LoadingTipsText_924901_Title": "Hsin's Chamber",
   "LoadingTipsText_925001_TipsText": "A data space within the control mainframe of Xuanfang Hold—a \"world within the Capsule.\" \nHere, historical data has reconstructed Xuanfang as it appeared two centuries ago.",
-  "LoadingTipsText_925001_Title": "Xuanyuan Domain: Outside Yuan Fortress",
+  "LoadingTipsText_925001_Title": "Xuanyuan Domain: Yuan Fortress Entrance",
   "LoadingTipsText_925101_TipsText": "Stay tuned",
