-  "LyricsText_800006_Translation": "<i>Alas, the fates of mortals bloom and wither in a fleeting breath</i>",
+  "LyricsText_800006_Translation": "<i>Alas, mortal fates rise and fade in a flash</i>",
   "LyricsText_800007_Original": "<i>惟愿 执长剑</i>",
