   "LyricsText_800011_Translation": "<i>I linger still, faint light mirrors my true heart</i>",
   "LyricsText_800012_Original": "<i>与君问剑， 清万籁，荡玄天</i>",
-  "LyricsText_800012_Translation": "<i>With you I cross my blade, all falls silent, heavens tremble</i>",
+  "LyricsText_800012_Translation": "<i>With you I test my blade, all falls silent, heavens stir</i>",
