   "LyricsText_800013_Translation": "<i>Side by side, we look back at lanterns shining bright</i>",
   "LyricsText_800014_Original": "<i>蓦然见，长风昭人间</i>",
-  "LyricsText_800014_Translation": "<i>We see, a world blessed by a blissful wind</i>",
+  "LyricsText_800014_Translation": "<i>And glimpse a world revealed by the long wind</i>",
