   "QuestTree_Summary_349901": "The Spacetrek Collective finishes sorting through the Fractsidus records recovered in the Dimmr Plains. Arman invites you to meet with him in person and shares what they found. From those materials, you finally learn the truth behind Denia's plan. Later, Sigrika tracks you down and tells you that before she left, Denia wrote her a letter confessing everything. Now that she knows the truth, Sigrika is finally able to accept her friend's decision to leave and face the future with renewed hope.",
   "QuestTree_Summary_410010": "With affairs in Lahai-Roi coming to a close, you decide to revisit Huanglong, only to unexpectedly learn of Yangyang's disappearance. To find her, you and Yangyang's older sister, Suisui, set out for the Land of Xuanfang in Mengzhou to investigate. Unbeknownst to you, an Autopuppet crisis is already brewing there...",
   "QuestTree_Summary_410020": "After overcoming numerous obstacles, you and Suisui successfully find Yangyang and obtain the token left behind by Mengzhou's Sentinel, Hsin the Moon Fox. Following the clues, you delve deeper into Xuanfang, and the mastermind of the chaos finally surfaces—Muyu, an Artisan from Mengzhou's Zhuojun Atelier. His goal is to get his hands on Sentinel technology and incite Autopuppets to lay siege to Xuanfang Hold.\nDuring the attempt to stop Muyu, Yangyang hears the Voice of the Streams for the first time, and in direct confrontation with the colossal Thousand-Puppet Pavilion Autopuppet Muyu created, she awakens new powers.\nHowever, after defeating the Thousand-Puppet Pavilion, you and Yangyang discover that the Muyu before you is only a shell. His true body remains hidden somewhere in Xuanfang.",
-  "QuestTree_Summary_410030": "You and Qingxiao met at Fogveil Pagoda, both of you searching for Hsin the Moon Fox, and all the while, a shutdown of the mechanisms was spreading quietly across the whole Land of Xuanfang. To find the source of the anomaly, the two of you traveled to the Sanctum together, only to arrive, unexpectedly, in the Land of Xuanfang of two hundred years ago. History had run a different course there: Yuan Fortress had come through the Fortress and Gorges War unscathed, and Cloud Shuttles still raced across the sky overhead...",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_410030": "You and Qingxiao met at Fogveil Pagoda, both of you searching for Hsin the Moon Fox, and all the while, a shutdown of the mechanisms was spreading quietly across the whole Land of Xuanfang. To find the source of the anomaly, the two of you traveled to the Sanctum together, only to arrive, unexpectedly, in the Land of Xuanfang of two hundred years ago. History had run a different course there: Yuan Fortress had come through the Fortress and Gorges War unscathed, and Cloud Shuttles raced across the sky overhead...",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_410040": "",
   "QuestTree_Summary_411000": "Days after the Autopuppet crisis, Yangyang chooses to remain in the Land of Xuanfang to help its soldiers and people. While waiting for her Resonance Evaluation Report, the Streams bring Yangyang back to the Gorges of Spirits, recreating the moment when she first met you. The Streams address Yangyang as the \"Votary of the Voice,\" and tell her that her true journey is only just beginning.",
-  "QuestTree_Summary_412000": "Not long after the crisis was over, you found Jingran standing before his parents' empty graves. There you learned what his past had been, and kept him company as he \"released\" the last of the Reverberations. The old dust was settled at last, and somewhere in the dark, something new had begun to stir...",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_412000": "Not long after the crisis was over, you found Jingran standing before his parents' empty graves. There you learned what his past had been, and kept him company as he \"freed\" the last of the Reverberations. The old dust was settled at last, and somewhere in the dark, something new had begun to stir...",
   "QuestTree_Summary_430101": "With your aid, the Constable uncovers the truth behind numerous incidents within Xuanfang Hold, all orchestrated by Fractsidus agents lurking in the city. You thwart their plot to destroy the Four Chime Shaftpost to escape the Hold, narrowly averting disaster. For a brief moment, peace returns to Xuanfang.",
   "QuestTree_Summary_430102": "You encounter Suyu, an injured Midnight Ranger, in Xuanfang. She tells you that she is here on a mission as an Oversight Officer, accompanying a unique Resonator. Seizing the chance, you join this Resonator in investigating a crisis unfolding in the Skyworks, and along the way, uncover the burdens she carries in her heart...",
   "QuestTree_Summary_430103": "A malfunctioning Autopuppet slips into the Fogveil Pagoda, where you also discover a master and his apprentice, T-G0NG and Q-L1NG, who have been sealed inside, faithfully maintaining their duties for over a century. They had been collecting data to study Xuanfang Hold's structure when the Autopuppet arrived with a message: \"Xuanfang Hold has already been completed. You may rest now.\" In the end, you help them reestablish contact with the outside world, and the Autopuppet often returns to the Pagoda to visit them.",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_430401": "",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_430402": "",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_430403": "",
   "QuestTree_Summary_440001": "Ruoyun asked for your help looking into a fragment of data hidden in the Xuanyuan Domain. In the course of the investigation, the two of you learned it was a Reverberation that had escaped the Domain long ago. Perhaps it was a miracle worked by that Reverberation's wish to see its family again.",
-  "QuestTree_Summary_440002": "Ruoyun asked for your help looking into a fragment of data hidden in the Xuanyuan Domain. In the course of the investigation, the two of you learned it was a Reverberation that had escaped the Domain long ago. Thinking back to what had happened to Lyu Yi, you understood that all of it was a miracle worked by the wish to see family again.",
+  "QuestTree_Summary_440002": "Ruoyun asked for your help looking into a fragment of data hidden in the Xuanyuan Domain. In the course of the investigation, the two of you learned it was a Reverberation that had escaped the Domain long ago. Thinking back to what had happened to Lyu Yi, you understood that it was all a miracle wrought by the wish to see family again.",
   "QuestTree_Summary_440003": "You investigated alongside Buling and uncovered the truth behind the \"ghosts.\" Lyu Yi's longing for his grandfather and the Reverberation's longing for its own family had wound together, and out of them came a brief miracle.",
   "QuestTree_Summary_440101": "Inside the Shadowcast Chamber of Fogveil Pagoda, you manipulate mechanisms to reshape shadows on the wall and solve a puzzle. The shifting silhouettes tell a story of the past, one where Hsin the Moon Fox sent Autopuppets to battle and sealed Tacet Discords within Censure Cages.",
   "QuestTree_Summary_440102": "Inside the Hunting Chamber of Fogveil Pagoda, you discover traces left by the malfunctioning Autopuppet that had slipped inside. Pursuing the illusions it left behind, you confirm that it eventually departed from here and returned to the Pagoda's Upper Foyer.",
