-  "Skill_1006101_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, consume STA to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, consume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, transforming into the Moon Fox on landing and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and in mid-air, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color>, continuously consuming STA and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> is released during <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color>, or when the skill ends, Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Reign at Ease - Plunging Attack</color>, consuming STA to perform a Plunging Attack, transforming into the Moon Fox upon landing and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Reign at Ease - Plunging Attack</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, use <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> generates a <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> at the target's position. Casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> causes the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> to collapse, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, consume STA to command Xuanfang Mechanisms, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Jump</color> to cast this skill, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, consume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, transforming into the Moon Fox upon landing and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, use <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 3</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006101_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, consume STA to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and in mid-air, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> then release the button to cast the skill at the cost of STA, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and in mid-air, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color>, continuously consuming STA and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color></size>\nWhen the <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> button is released during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color>, or when the skill ends, Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease </color>, consuming STA to perform a Plunging Attack, transforming into the Moon Fox upon landing and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack- Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, use <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> generates a <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> at the target's position. Casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> causes the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> to collapse, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, consume STA to command Xuanfang Mechanisms, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Jump</color> to cast this skill, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and Hsin is in mid-air, <color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> is repalced with <color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, use <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 3</color>.",
   "Skill_1006101_SkillName": "Manifold Bloom",
   "Skill_1006101_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Enhanced Attack</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is enhanced, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> and consuming <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006102_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, if Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to have Hsin dart into the air and then transform into the Moon Fox upon landing, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\nIf Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, She turns into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Dodge</color>, taking a hit, or switching to another Resonator ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tapping PC=Pressing Gamepad=Pressing} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\nWhile turned into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> and out of combat, Hsin restores {0} of Max HP per second.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if Hsin is on the ground or in mid-air close to the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nIf Hsin is in mid-air, casting this skill will not put it on Cooldown, and will instead cast <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color> to descend to the ground.",
+  "Skill_1006102_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, if Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\n\nIf Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, She turns into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color>. \n- While turned into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> and out of combat, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>. With <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>, Hsin can enter the target's aggro range without triggering combat. <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color> is removed when Hsin enters combat, is switched out, or ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form by having environmental, gameplay, or feature interactions.\n- While turned into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> and out of combat, Hsin restores {0} of Max HP each second.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> or taking damage ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and makes Hsin immune to DMG and interruption for a short time. Switching to another Resonator or {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tapping PC=pressing Gamepad=pessing} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006102_SkillName": "Heartward by Moon",
   "Skill_1006102_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold a directional key while casting this skill to turn Hsin into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> after a short time. While out of combat, She restores a certain amount of HP per second.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006103_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Formshift</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Formshift</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin turns into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, engaging in <color=Highlight>quest dialogue</color>, performing a <color=Highlight>environmental interaction with an animation</color>, or using a <color=Highlight>Utility</color> switches Hsin back to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> to perform the corresponding action.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in the deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Pillars Across Heaven</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nHsin returns to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Edict</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> also grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Edict</color>, up to <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0}.\nWhen the active Resonator in the team deals DMG, Hsin consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> to summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation DMG</color>.\n- For the next {1}s after DMG is dealt, 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> can be consumed automatically each second to summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color>. This effect can be triggered once per second, and DMG dealt by <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> can be summoned at most once per second, up to {0} times in total.\n- The effect lasts {2}s, or until all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are fully consumed.\n- When Hsin is knocked out, all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are cleared.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heart Manifest</color></size>\nIncreases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> has not been unlocked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Answering</color></size>\nHsin temporarily reverts to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, pausing the duration timer of the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state.\nWhen this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Illumining</color></size>\nHsin turns back into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, resuming the duration timer of the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state.\nWhen this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006103_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Formshift</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Formshift</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin turns into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, engaging in <color=Highlight>quest dialogue</color>, performing a <color=Highlight>environmental interaction with an animation</color>, or using a <color=Highlight>Utility</color> switches Hsin back to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> to perform the corresponding action.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in the deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and air-borne.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Pillars Across Heaven</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nHsin returns to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Edict</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> for {2}s. The effect cannot exceed <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.\nAfter the active Resonator in the team deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes <color=Highlight>Edict</color> in the following {1}s trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the durtion:\n- When <color=Highlight>Edict</color> is consumed, summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>. \n- <color=Highlight>Edict</color> can be automatically consumed up to 1 stack per second.\n- Damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- When Hsin is knocked out, all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are cleared.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heart Manifest</color></size>\nIncreases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> has not been unlocked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Answering</color></size>\nHsin temporarily reverts to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, pausing the duration timer of the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state.\nWhen this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Illumining</color></size>\nHsin turns back into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, resuming the duration timer of the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state.\nWhen this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.",
   "Skill_1006103_SkillName": "Nexus Alight",
   "Skill_1006103_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Liberation</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>. Enter <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color></size>\nDeal massive <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> and return Hsin to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Coordinated Attack</color></size>\nAfter <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> is cast, Hsin performs Coordinated Attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006104_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, when Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color>, She gains {0} Electro DMG Bonus for {1}s. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, Hsin gains {2} Electro DMG Bonus, stacking up to {3} times. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, while in combat, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, both Hsin and Rover: Electro gain {6} Electro DMG Bonus.\nThis effect resets when a Resonator is added to the team or when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
+  "Skill_1006104_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, when Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color>, She gains {0} Electro DMG Bonus for {1}s. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, Hsin gains {2} Electro DMG Bonus, stacking up to {3} times. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, when Rover: Electro casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Thunderous Fury</color>, both Hsin and Rover: Electro gain {6} Electro DMG Bonus for 7s.\nThis effect resets when a Resonator is added to the team or when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
   "Skill_1006104_SkillName": "Tides of Succession",
   "Skill_1006104_SkillResume": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Hsin deals more DMG for a certain time after casting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Intro Skill</color>.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, when Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color>, Hsin deals more DMG. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, while in combat, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, Hsin and Rover: Electro deal more Electro DMG.",
-  "Skill_1006105_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, the maximum stacks of the <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> effect on Resonators in the team are increased by {0}, and gaining <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> for the first time grants {0} additional stacks.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, while Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, Hsin gains 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> after Resonators in the team other than Hsin inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, stacking up to {1} times.\nWhile in combat, while Hsin is in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, Hsin applies <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> to targets within a certain range nearby, raising their stacks to match her own <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> stacks, and those targets no longer lose <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks each time it is triggered automatically. Each target can trigger this effect at most once while Hsin is in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nExiting the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state resets the number of times the above effect can be triggered and clears all of Hsin's own <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> stacks.",
+  "Skill_1006105_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, the maximum stacks of the <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> effect on Resonators in the team are increased by {0}. When a Resonator in the team triggers <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, all Resonators in the team gain <SapTag=1>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> for {2}s. This effect can only grant up to <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=1} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color> and Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, Hsin gains 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> after Resonators in the team other than Hsin inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, stacking up to {1} times.\nWhile Hsin is in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, when targets within a certain range around the active Resonator have 0 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, inflict 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the targets. If <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> on Hsin reaches the stack limit, Hsin also inflicts <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> on the targets:\n- When Hsin inflicts <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> on the target, she also inflicts <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target to the stack limit, up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> is active, if the maximum stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target are increased, Hsin will inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target to the stack limit again, up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> is active, the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks on the target will not be reduced when automatically triggered.\n- <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> will be removed when the target leaves the designated range around Hsin.\nExiting the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state or switching Resonance Mode removes the effects mentioned above.",
   "Skill_1006105_SkillName": "Gleaning Simple Joys",
-  "Skill_1006105_SkillResume": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> stacks on Resonators in the team are increased.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Hsin records the number of <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> stacks that Resonators in the team other than Hsin apply to targets. For a certain time after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, Hsin applies <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> to targets within a certain range nearby, raising their stacks to match the recorded count, and those targets no longer lose <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> stacks each time it is triggered automatically.",
-  "Skill_1006106_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, the skill inflicts <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the targets hit.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> and in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, the following will replace <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color>:\n- When Hsin is switched in by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> through <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>.\n- When Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> without triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> while holding <color=Highlight><te href=131119>Source Intent</te></color>, consuming <color=Highlight><te href=131119>Source Intent</te></color> instead.\nCast <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> to attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, the skill inflicts <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the targets hit.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, the following will replace <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color>:\n- When Hsin is switched in by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> through <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>.\n- When Hsin casts an <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> without triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> while holding <color=Highlight><te href=131119>Source Intent</te></color>, consuming <color=Highlight><te href=131119>Source Intent</te></color> instead.\nCast <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> to attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006105_SkillResume": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> stacks on Resonators in the team are increased.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, for a certain time after Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, She inflicts <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> on the targets within a certain range nearby to the stack limit, and those targets no longer lose <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> stacks each time it is triggered automatically.",
+  "Skill_1006106_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>) or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>).\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThe skill becomes available when in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThe skill becomes available when in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006106_SkillName": "Glance on a Whim",
-  "Skill_1006106_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Enhanced Intro Skill</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, each time the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is triggered, this <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> and the next become <color=Highlight>Enhanced Intro Skill</color>, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006107_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Forms Born of Heart</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast the skill at the cost of STA and {0} points of <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color>. Hsin is immune to DMG and interruption during the action, and deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color>. This <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> consumes <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color> to become <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color> can only be gained once every {16}s.\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color>, if Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> is unlocked.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Hsin consumes all of her <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> during the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack</color> is replaced by <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast it, consuming STA and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> is cast, Hsin gains <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color>. This <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> consumes <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color> to be enhanced into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color> can only be gained once every {16}s.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color>, Hsin exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state and <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color> is unlocked.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> reaches {1} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to surrounding targets, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, Hsin enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mechanism Dominion</color></size>\nThe <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state lasts {2}s.\nWhile this state is active, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color> is further enhanced into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> hits a target, <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> is consumed if Hsin is on the field.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Unison</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- Hsin has the <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> ability, and each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> increases the total DMG She deals.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>. This can only occur once every {3}s.\n- When Hsin is switched in by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> through <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, She gains <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast this time is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\nWhen Hsin casts an <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> without triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> while holding <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, She consumes <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color> instead, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast this time undergoes the same replacement.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> sends Hsin directly into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- After Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> to a target, every <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> inflicted grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, stacking up to {5} times, and consumes all <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> stacks from that target. <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- While casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, Hsin consumes <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> each time. When She hits a target holding <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, one instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG equal to {8} of the original DMG is triggered based on that target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks. If <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> falls below <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} during this time, the consumption is paused.\nAfter a certain time, if Hsin still holds <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, all remaining stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> are consumed at once. When She hits a target holding <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, one instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG equal to {9} of the original DMG multiplied by the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks consumed is triggered based on that target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks.\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early will end the above effects early.\n- After <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> is cast, or when <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> hits a target, Hsin inflicts <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> to that target. This can take effect up to {12} times. Each time Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, the number of times it can take effect is reset. When Hsin switches Resonance Mode, the number of times it can take effect is removed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {0} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Reign at Ease</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color> if She is on the field.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> grants {13} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {1} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, when <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if She is on the field.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> directly sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state and grants {10} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> is cast, the next time the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> generated by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> is collpased by casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, gain {11} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.",
