-  "Skill_1006109_MultiSkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> equal to {0} of Hsin's ATK.\nHsin gains <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color>. When Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> is consumed to trigger various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color> She is in:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, all DMG dealt by nearby Resonators in the team other than Hsin that have the <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> ability is Amplified by {1} for {2}s.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by nearby Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified by {3} for {4}s.\nThe above effects end early when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
