+  "Skill_1006109_SkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> equal to {0} of Hsin's ATK.\nHsin gains <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color>. When Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> is consumed to trigger various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color> She is in:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain <color=Highlight>Shared Light</color> when they gain <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>. After Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, Resonators with <color=Highlight>Shared Light</color> gain {1} All DMG Amplification for {2}s.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified by {3} for {4}s.\nThe above effects end early when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
   "Skill_1006109_SkillName": "Herself a Thousand Lanterns",
-  "Skill_1006109_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color> is cast, casting this skill triggers various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color>:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, all DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin that have the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> ability is Amplified.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified.",
-  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nPerform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unfurled Canopy - Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Dodge Counter</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006109_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color> is cast, casting this skill triggers various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color>:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain All DMG Amplification when they have gained <color=Highlight>Unison</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified.",
+  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight> Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
