-  "Skill_1006207_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Furled Canopy - Sealed Delusion</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Furled Canopy - Sealed Delusion</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> DMG.\n- Suoming enters the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state after casting this skill, clearing all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unfurled Canopy - Unforsaken Mind</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Unforsaken Mind</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> DMG.\n- Suoming enters the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state after casting this skill, clearing all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Umbral Canopy - Engraved Heart</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Calamity Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Umbral Canopy - Engraved Heart</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Umbral Canopy - Engraved Heart</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> DMG.\n- Suoming enters the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state after casting this skill and consuming all stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131202>Obsession</te></color>.\n- When casting this skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to continuously attack the target for a certain period.\n- If this skill is not cast, Suoming will enter the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state after a certain period, clearing all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Calamity Mind</color> state, Suoming is immune to interruption, but becomes immobilized and cannot cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>, <color=Highlight>Plunging Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>. Resonator switching is also restricted in this state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nSuoming is capable of <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>. When switched in by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, she casts her own Intro Skill.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, the incoming Resonator casts their own Intro Skill. Meanwhile, Suoming casts her own Outro Skill, and her <color=Highlight>Unison</color> is removed. When Suoming's Concerto Energy is full and she has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, only the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is consumed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Delusion</color></size>\nSuoming can hold up to {0} points of Delusion.\n- Hitting a target with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 1</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>, <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy Stage 1</color>, <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>, <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>, <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>, or <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Crimson Gleam</color> grants Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=1} of Delusion.\n- Entering the field by casting Intro Skill grants <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=2} of Delusion.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Obsession</color></size>\nSuoming can hold up to <SapTag=3>{3}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=3} of Obsession.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Furled Canopy - Sealed Delusion</color> or <color=Highlight>Unfurled Canopy - Unforsaken Mind</color> grants 1 stack of Obsession.",
+  "Skill_1006205_SkillResume": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect.\nWhile this effect is active, Suoming's <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> increases the incoming Resonator's Electro DMG Bonus.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and grants the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, and increases Suoming's Crit. DMG.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006206_SkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.",
