+  "Skill_1006206_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006207_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {4} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {4} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to cast this skill. Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Calamity Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>; she enters <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> once the skill ends.\n- When casting this skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to continuously attack the target for a certain period.\n- While casting this skill, Suoming is immune to interruption. During this time she cannot move, sprint, jump, dodge, or cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>, <color=Highlight>Plunging Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, and Resonator switching is also restricted.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to another Resonator will remove her <color=Highlight>Unison</color> to trigger Suoming's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. When Suoming's Concerto Energy is full and she has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, only the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is consumed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nSuoming can trigger <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color>.\nWhen a Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, swiching to Suoming grants all Resonators in the team <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> for {1}s.\nSuoming can grant up to <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> this way. Gaining it again only resets the duration.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Boon</color></size>\nEach stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases DMG dealt by Resonators in the team who can trigger <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> by {2}%, up to {3} stacks.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Delusion Gain Rules</color></size>\nCan hold up to {4} points of Delusion.\n- Hitting a target with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> grants Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=5} of Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=6} of Delusion.",
