+  "Skill_1006207_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight>Delusion</color> is full, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced by <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight>Delusion</color> is full, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced by <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting this skill, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to cast this skill. Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and switches to another Resonator, the incoming Resonator casts their own Intro Skill, Suoming casts her own Outro Skill, and her <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is removed. When Suoming's Concerto Energy is full and she has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, only the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is consumed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nSuoming has the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> ability.\nWhen a Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and switches to Suoming, all Resonators in the team gain <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Delusion Gain Rules</color></size>\nHitting a target with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> grants Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants Delusion.",
