   "Term130903_Title": "Apex Resonance",
   "Term131110_Desc": "When the current Resonator has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to another Resonator will have the incoming Resonator cast their own Intro Skill and the current Resonator cast their own Outro Skill, removing the current Resonator's <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect. When the current Resonator's Concerto Energy reaches its maximum and they also have the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect, only the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is consumed.",
   "Term131110_Title": "Unison",
-  "Term131111_Desc": "Each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators in the team with the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> ability by 3%.",
+  "Term131111_Desc": "Each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases DMG dealt by Resonators in the team who can trigger <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> by {0}%, up to {1} stacks.",
   "Term131111_Title": "Unison Boon",
-  "Term131112_Desc": "When Resonators in the team have <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to a Resonator with the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> ability will switch that Resonator in by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, granting the following effects:\n- Resonators in the team gain 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> for 30s.\n- Each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators in the team with the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> ability by 3%.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> effect is active, each Resonator in the team can provide at most 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> to switch in. A Resonator that has already provided <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> only refreshes the duration when switched in by triggering <color=Highlight>Unison</color> again.",
+  "Term131112_Desc": "This Resonator can trigger <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color>.\nWhen a Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to this Resonator grants all Resonators in the team <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of Unison Boon.\nThis Resonator can grant up to <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> in this way. Gaining it again only resets the duration.",
   "Term131112_Title": "Unison Response",
-  "Term131113_Desc": "- After Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight>Electro Rage</color> to a target, every <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight>Electro Rage</color> infllicted grants Hsin <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, stacking up to {5} times, and removes all <color=Highlight>Electro Rage</color> stacks from that target. <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- While casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, Hsin consumes <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> each time. When she hits a target holding <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color>, one instance of <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> DMG equal to {8} of the original DMG is triggered based on that target's current <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> stacks. If <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> falls below <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} during this time, the consumption is paused.\nAfter a certain time, if Hsin still holds <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, all remaining stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> are consumed at once. When she hits a target holding <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color>, one instance of <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> DMG equal to {9} of the original DMG multiplied by the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks consumed is triggered based on that target's current <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> stacks.\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early will end the above effects early.",
+  "Term131113_Desc": "- After Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> to a target, every <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> inflicted grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, stacking up to {5} times, and consumes all <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> stacks from that target. <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- When <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>hits a target, if Hsin has at least <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, then consume <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> to trigger 1 instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG, with its DMG Multiplier equal to {8} times the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks on the target.\nSome time after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, Hsin consumes all remaining stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> at once to trigger 1 instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG. Its DMG Multiplier equals to {9} x (the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks consumed this time) x (the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks).\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early will end the above effects early.",
   "Term131113_Title": "Heart of Thunder",
-  "Term131114_Desc": "When <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> is cast, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Resolution of Wishes</color>. This <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Resolution of Wishes</color> to be enhanced into <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight>Resolution of Wishes</color> can only be gained once every {16}s.",
+  "Term131114_Desc": "Casting <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight>Resolution of Wishes</color>. This <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Resolution of Wishes</color> to become <color=Highlight>Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight>Resolution of Wishes</color> can only be gained once every {16}s.",
   "Term131114_Title": "Resolution of Wishes",
-  "Term131115_Desc": "When <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> is cast, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Law of Heaven</color>. This <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Law of Heaven</color> to be enhanced into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight>Law of Heaven</color> can only be gained once every {16}s.",
+  "Term131115_Desc": "Casting <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight>Law of Heaven</color>. This <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Law of Heaven</color> to become <color=Highlight>Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight>Law of Heaven</color> can only be gained once every {16}s.",
   "Term131115_Title": "Law of Heaven",
